BT /F2 13 Tf 64 742 Td (Policy statement) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 722 Td (Grevya is committed to a workplace free from sexual harassment. This policy is framed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 707 Td (under the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace \(Prevention, Prohibition and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 692 Td (Redressal\) Act, 2013 and applies to all employees, interns, contractors and visitors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 677 Td (Grevya extends the same protection to employees of every gender.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 646 Td (What is sexual harassment) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 626 Td (Sexual harassment includes any unwelcome act or behaviour, whether direct or implied,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 611 Td (such as:) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 590 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 590 Td (Physical contact and advances, or a demand or request for sexual favours.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 569 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 569 Td (Sexually coloured remarks, jokes or messages, including over chat, email or social) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 554 Td (media.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 533 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 533 Td (Showing pornography or any other unwelcome physical, verbal or non-verbal conduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 518 Td (of a sexual nature.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 487 Td (Internal Committee) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 467 Td (Grevya has constituted an Internal Committee \(IC\) chaired by a senior woman employee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 452 Td (and including an external member from an NGO. The names and contact details of IC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 437 Td (members are displayed at every office and published in People Success. Complaints can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 422 Td (be sent to ic@grevya.com.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 391 Td (Making a complaint) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 371 Td (A written complaint should be made within three months of the incident. The IC will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 356 Td (complete its inquiry within 90 days, keeping the identities of the parties and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 341 Td (witnesses confidential. Interim relief, such as a change of reporting line or leave,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 326 Td (may be granted during the inquiry.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 295 Td (Awareness) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 275 Td (All employees complete POSH awareness training within 30 days of joining and every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 260 Td (year thereafter, tracked in Learning in People Success.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 229 Td (Compliance and exceptions) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 209 Td (Violations of this policy may lead to disciplinary action up to and including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 194 Td (termination of employment, in line with the Grevya Code of Conduct and applicable law.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 173 Td (Exceptions must be approved in writing by the People Success team and the relevant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 158 Td (function head. Approved exceptions are recorded in People Success and reviewed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 143 Td (annually.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
